51:25.405 --> 51:26.045
Dedication.

51:26.806 --> 51:39.252
Through the merit of this heartfelt aspiration to practice the seven points of mind training, the heart essence of the incomparable Joe Atisha and his heirs, may all beings attain the level of perfect awakening.

51:40.352 --> 51:49.114
And so here, it is important to reflect that this particular tradition is the heart essence, we read, of the incomparable Atisha.

51:49.694 --> 51:52.975
It is the Dharma of his activity, if you like.

51:53.355 --> 52:01.077
It is the quintessence of his very being, arranged in seven constituent parts, renowned as the seven points of mind training.

52:01.517 --> 52:10.079
And so here, we are making the aspiration that this particular spiritual instruction become blended with our very being and one with us

